                }

                div { class "docs-card"
                    h3 "Env vars in pages (public allow-list)"
                    p "Security note: .tw pages only have access to environment variables you explicitly mark as public. Every other variable -..."
                }

                div { class "docs-card"
                    h3 "Environment variable validation"
                    p "Declare required env vars in tw.config: env: required: 'FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID, DATABASE_URL, API_TOKEN' tw dev will warn a..."
